{
  "_about": "Design tokens for myanime. Roles follow replica-design; values are myanime's own palette (dark UI, mint accent). Source of truth: scripts/build-tokens.mjs turns this file into src/styles/tokens.css. Check every change with: python3 .claude/skills/replica-design/contrast.py replica/design/tokens.json",
